{
  "id": "p07",
  "title": "The Ninth Floor",
  "titleZh": "九楼的第一周",
  "topic": "职场",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "My first week as a new student here already feels busy and long.",
        "zh": "我作为新学生在这里的第一周已经感觉又忙又漫长。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The busy office on the ninth floor is thirty metres wide and bright.",
        "zh": "九楼那间忙碌的办公室有三十米宽，而且很明亮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A tall silver door stands wide open all day.",
        "zh": "一扇高大的银色门整天敞开着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The man in the blue shirt simply nods and says yes.",
        "zh": "蓝衬衫的男人只是点点头，说了声“是”。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The director wants a short, simple speech from me today.",
        "zh": "今天主管想让我做一段简短的发言。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The job requires a clear, calm and very steady voice.",
        "zh": "这份工作需要清晰、沉稳而非常平稳的嗓音。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her kind advice offers a simple, useful method for us.",
        "zh": "她善意的建议为我们提供了一个简单有用的方法。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One long, difficult sentence still gives him real trouble today.",
        "zh": "一个又长又难的句子仍然让他很头疼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My small diary has a dozen empty white pages left.",
        "zh": "我的小日记本还剩十几页空白。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mum loves cooking for the whole family each Sunday.",
        "zh": "我妈妈喜欢每个星期天为全家人做饭。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Her husband brings a warm lunch to the busy office.",
        "zh": "她丈夫把热腾腾的午饭带到繁忙的办公室。"
      },
      {
        "en": "During the evening, a glass of red wine adds gentle pleasure.",
        "zh": "傍晚时，一杯红酒添了几分温和的惬意。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The little shop downstairs sells warm, fresh bread every morning.",
        "zh": "楼下的小店每天早上都卖热乎乎的新鲜面包。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I buy a ticket for the southern night train.",
        "zh": "我买了一张南下列车的车票。"
      },
      {
        "en": "In early spring, a visitor from the warm south arrives.",
        "zh": "早春时节，一位来自温暖南方的访客到了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A kind old engineer pulls a wooden chair nearby at once.",
        "zh": "一位好心的老工程师立刻搬来一把木椅。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A happy smile appears at noon each working day.",
        "zh": "每天中午，一个快乐的笑容都会出现。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I cannot believe my own tired, red eye.",
        "zh": "我无法相信自己疲惫发红的眼睛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He insists on doing the heavy work all by himself.",
        "zh": "他坚持所有重活都自己一个人干。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Sir, please wait in the quiet front hall instead of leaving.",
        "zh": "先生，请别走，在安静的前厅等一会儿。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a woman of middle age quietly waits outside alone.",
        "zh": "随后，一位中年妇人独自在外面静静地等着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The total cost will rise again next cold winter month.",
        "zh": "接着，下个寒冷的冬月里总成本还会再涨。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The full report looks smooth and very neat this morning.",
        "zh": "今早这份完整的报告看上去平整又非常整洁。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He dares to pay the fine completely alone today.",
        "zh": "他今天完全独自一人敢去交这笔罚款。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I rush out, and besides, the grey sky turns dark.",
        "zh": "我冲了出去，而且天色也变暗了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "If the box is heavy, do not lift it alone.",
        "zh": "如果箱子很重，就不要一个人搬。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The small office is quite warm, almost too warm inside.",
        "zh": "这间小办公室相当暖和，几乎太暖了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later your chair stood empty a whole month ago.",
        "zh": "你的椅子空了整整一个月。"
      }
    ]
  ],
